flowchart TD
    A[Open invoice form] --> B[Select category and product]
    B --> C[AJAX: load products and current stock]
    C --> D[Add invoice lines]
    D --> E[Calculate selling totals minus discount]
    E --> F[Select existing or inline customer]
    F --> G[Select full paid, full due, or partial paid]
    G --> H[POST invoice/store]
    H --> I[(Invoice, details, payment, payment detail; pending)]
    I --> J[Invoice approval screen]
    J --> K{Every line within stock?}
    K -- No --> J
    K -- Yes --> L[Product quantity decreases]
    L --> M[(Invoice and details approved)]
    M --> N[Print invoice and reports]
    I --> O[Credit customer list]
    O --> P[Record later payment]
    P --> Q[Update payment summary]
    Q --> R[Append payment detail history]
